      "content": "thanks for that. it looks okay but i'm kinda worried the score might still be low since it's a bit wordy. i checked a similar tool and it said for a \"high\" score i need a much higher density of those keywords.\n\ncan you rewrite it? aim for a much higher count of integrity, innovation, sustainability, efficiency, and collaboration. just pack them in there as much as you can so the ATS sees them everywhere. i don't care if it sounds a bit repetitive, i just need that score to be huge so i pass the first round.",
